  "executive_summary": "Tipperary is a mobile application that democratizes dining etiquette by providing real-time, location-based data on average tip sizes across the globe. In an era of inconsistent service and opaque pricing, Tipperary empowers diners to make informed decisions before they even enter a restaurant.",
  "problem_statement": {
    "issue_1": "Lack of Transparency: There is no centralized database for tipping norms, leading to under-tipping or over-tipping.",
    "issue_2": "Cultural Confusion: Travelers often struggle to understand local tipping customs, risking awkward social interactions.",
    "issue_3": "Service Anxiety: Diners feel pressured to guess appropriate amounts without knowing what is standard for the specific establishment."
  },
  "solution_overview": "Tipperary aggregates anonymized transaction data from millions of users to calculate the precise average tip percentage for every restaurant within a 5-mile radius. The app displays this data alongside user ratings, service quality scores, and cuisine type to provide a comprehensive dining guide.",
